# Build-context hygiene for infrastructure/docker/Dockerfile.* (built from
# the repository root). Keeps host artifacts out of the image and guarantees
# no local secrets or databases ever enter a build context.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
.env
.env.*
*.local
infrastructure/compose
infrastructure/helm
infrastructure/terraform
docs
